Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.06,0:00:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you eat it all up!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.81,0:00:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.20,0:00:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious ukogi leaves.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.24,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.55,0:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more if you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The hedge?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.33,0:00:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If we eat the whole hedge,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.15,0:00:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to see straight into the next building!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.72,0:00:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the wife and daughter there are changing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.08,0:00:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Next door is my house.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.01,0:00:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How did things get so bad that \NI'm reduced to eating leaves?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.59,0:00:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. They're actually good.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.10,0:00:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat them and you're sure \Nto get a promotion!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.32,0:00:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The recipe's been passed down in these barracks for generations!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.80,0:00:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, "If you want\Nreal food, get a promotion"?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.25,0:00:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.74,0:00:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Unless you start eating food with more nutrients, you'll never grow.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.04,0:00:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw Katsuie's rack, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.94,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She gets to eat delicious food\Nbecause she's Nobuna's minister,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.62,0:01:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and so she's got those jiggly melons.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.62,0:01:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Breasts are just for decoration!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.56,0:01:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! We were just talking \Nabout your breasts—
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.06,0:01:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, please come with me.
