Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.37,0:02:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In Owari Province, a new market system has
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.02,0:02:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,allowed people the right to trade freely,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.03,0:03:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,bringing more prosperity than the people have ever known.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.90,0:03:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Inuchiyo, why are you following us?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.02,0:03:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.91,0:03:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you can.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.92,0:03:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two having a tryst?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.02,0:03:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.03,0:03:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Inuchiyo, go home.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.45,0:03:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us adults to have fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.00,0:03:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fun with fat?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.76,0:03:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Boobs aren't fat!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.81,0:03:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're filled with men's hopes and dreams!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.85,0:03:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How uncouth.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.75,0:03:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd take a look at my sister's monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.65,0:03:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd see this.
