Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.52,0:03:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In our history, Nobunaga's little brother...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.46,0:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe a monkey is a good match\Nfor my stupid and boorish sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.38,0:04:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're calling your \Nolder sister a fool?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.04,0:04:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's a boor!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.11,0:04:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, hold your tongue.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.92,0:04:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's insulting Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.38,0:04:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a minister of the Oda family,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.28,0:04:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but my official position \Nis Master Nobukatsu's aide.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.79,0:04:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in his command.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.34,0:04:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.94,0:04:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what my sister did at Father's funeral...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.19,0:04:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\t(2324,0,\c&H000000&\3c&xH000000&\4c&H000000&)}She just had to put on \Nthat stupid tough act.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.89,0:04:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If I leave the country to her,\NOwari will be ruined.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.74,0:04:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, what about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.18,0:04:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What would {\i1}you{\i0} do with Owari?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.42,0:04:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have some ambition \Nfor the country?{meh}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.55,0:04:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use a national campaign to get everyone to eat rice jelly!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.97,0:04:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Disqualified!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.21,0:04:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not worthy of being a count!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.01,0:04:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The best you could be is \Nthe governor of a prefecture!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.97,0:04:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it back!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.56,0:04:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy the Imagawa and Saitou!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.23,0:04:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.94,0:05:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring all the cute girls to Owari!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.99,0:05:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Me and him might actually get along, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.74,0:05:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's still no good!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.42,0:05:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If {\i1}you{\i0} could be a count, \Nthen even I could!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.73,0:05:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, my sister is a fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.98,0:05:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,An embarrassment to the Oda clan!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.83,0:05:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Mother hated her since she \Nwas a child, never speaking to her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.19,0:05:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Violent, selfish, and always \Nfriendly with barbarians...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.13,0:05:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All she talked about was rifles and conquest.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.64,0:05:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see why my mother didn't like her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.05,0:05:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother said that I should've been the one to succeed my father, not my foolish sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.74,0:05:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.54,0:05:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.05,0:05:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Never call your sister a fool again.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.54,0:05:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time you say that, \NI'll really whack you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.28,0:05:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You hit me! You've already hit me!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.29,0:05:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a mere soldier!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.91,0:05:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have your head! Off with his head!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.24,0:05:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you've done?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.21,0:06:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Nobukatsu ordered me to cut off\NMonkey's head and deliver it to him.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.58,0:06:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.21,0:06:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse, he'll start \Nanother rebellion.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.29,0:06:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He always does.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.67,0:06:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll give him Yoshiharu's head?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.84,0:06:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah—As if we would!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.57,0:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But rebellion would be a problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.96,0:06:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Oda family is divided in two...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.02,0:06:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lecture me!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.43,0:06:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose fault do you think this is?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.11,0:06:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If Master Nobukatsu rebels,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.51,0:06:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll have to fight Lord Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.23,0:06:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The only option here is to cut off Monkey's head!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.62,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your sword away!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.84,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Katsuie.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.74,0:06:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If a foot soldier hits him, \Nthat's clearly unacceptable.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.71,0:06:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he were higher ranked, \Na general for instance,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.77,0:06:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,then couldn't we work something out?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.76,0:06:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,From foot soldier to\Ngeneral in one step, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.27,0:06:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,However, he'd have to earn that title.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.68,0:07:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,3000 kan...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.27,0:07:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Use 3000 kan to bring me 8000\Nkoku worth of rice in one week.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.08,0:07:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But at Owari's market prices,\Nhe'd only be able to buy 4000 koku.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.76,0:07:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can't do that,\Nhe doesn't deserve it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.41,0:07:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you want me to get as much rice\Nas I can at half the market rate.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.54,0:07:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.24,0:07:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Scripted event time!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.17,0:07:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't do it in a week, \Nyou're going to lose your head.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.38,0:07:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.13,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a way to make money that\Nnever failed me in the game.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.98,0:07:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Game?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.52,0:07:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand that either.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.18,0:07:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.06,0:07:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm told you need lots of rice.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.19,0:07:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kawanami ninjas \Nwere originally thieves.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.25,0:07:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking and entering is a \Nsim... simple task for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.73,0:07:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stutter when you're talking \Nabout doing something illegal.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.17,0:07:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to do \Nanything like that. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.99,0:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's 8000 koku!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.96,0:08:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to increase \Nmy 3000 kan to 6000 kan.
