Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:13.26,fuckingmap,,0,0,0,,{\alpha85\alpha&H00&\fs1.5\fscx1176\t(-97,2,\fscx1177)\fscy1171\t(-30,69,\fscy1172)\c&H1B1E1E&\blur0.75\pos(1597.89,414.135)}Town of\NInoguchi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:13.30,fuckingmap,,0,0,0,,{\alpha85\alpha&H00&\fs1.5\fscx1176\t(-97,2,\fscx1177)\fscy1171\t(-30,69,\fscy1172)\c&H1B1E1E&\blur0.75\pos(1597.89,414.135)}Town of\NInoguchi
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.29,0:08:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I keep doing this, making 6000\Nkan won't take any time at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.20,0:08:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned this trick in Romance of the \NTwo Kingdoms and Age of Exploration!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,His failure's all but decided.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.57,0:08:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait a week!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.30,0:08:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.54,0:08:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If Lord Nobuna doesn't give you \Nhis head after the week is up,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.74,0:08:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you have the perfect excuse to rebel.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.25,0:08:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to make the tea more calmly.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.34,0:08:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.66,0:08:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all the same when \Nit's in your stomach.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.34,0:08:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, how's Monkey doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.93,0:08:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you worried?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.17,0:08:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm just asking!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.25,0:08:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Nobukatsu?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.87,0:09:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's preparing for war.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.00,0:09:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you forgive him again?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.75,0:09:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's your flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.90,0:09:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't unite my own house,\N then Japan is beyond me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.39,0:09:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much Mother begs,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.38,0:09:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving him another chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.78,0:09:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty points.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.07,0:09:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}With this much money, \Nthe ladies will flock to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.22,0:09:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so greedy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.04,0:09:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed in you, Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.21,0:09:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what you like!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.36,0:09:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Money is power!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You have money,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.05,0:09:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but not a single grain of rice.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.55,0:09:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I got so obsessed with making money\Nthat I forgot my original goal!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.14,0:09:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,When's the deadline?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.85,0:09:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This evening.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.42,0:09:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.17,0:09:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.21,0:09:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't there any rice?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.46,0:09:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the money I gave you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.13,0:09:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you blow it on gambling?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.52,0:09:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.65,0:09:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually increased it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.74,0:10:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Trade secret.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.76,0:10:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're using Monkey Language to trick me!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.10,0:10:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Inuchiyo and the others are buying the\Nrice and bringing it here right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.42,0:10:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.73,0:10:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.90,0:10:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're that sure,\NI'll wait until evening.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.17,0:10:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They're late.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.59,0:10:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.83,0:10:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You just sat down!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.93,0:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how impatient are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.46,0:10:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But waiting is boring.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.52,0:10:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm bored, I feel like killing monkeys.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.67,0:10:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk to kill {\i1}time{\i0}, instead.{probably not supposed to be a joke}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.57,0:10:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.97,0:10:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll use this globe \Nto judge your intelligence.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.00,0:10:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.11,0:10:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your challenge.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.66,0:10:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what this globe means?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.54,0:10:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's not flat.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.53,0:10:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like this, it's round.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.93,0:10:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.84,0:11:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're lying.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.23,0:11:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's common knowledge in my world.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.89,0:11:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do you know where Japan is?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.22,0:11:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This tiny island country, I'm told.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.81,0:11:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The people you call "barbarians" come from all the way over here, in Europe.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.69,0:11:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Spain and Portugal...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.81,0:11:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amazing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.26,0:11:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobody I've explained this \Nto has ever believed me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.97,0:11:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The barbarians will \Ninvade Japan someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.08,0:11:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to make a country that can\Nstand up to them as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.46,0:11:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is what I'm saying strange?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.28,0:11:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm a fool?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.07,0:11:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.76,0:11:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just too much of a genius.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.64,0:11:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The people who laugh at you \Ndon't understand that.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.43,0:11:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna, you're special.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.16,0:11:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.06,0:11:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You say the same thing, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.48,0:11:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As who?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.73,0:11:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone I care about deeply.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.98,0:12:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The person who told me about the world.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.17,0:12:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The person you care about?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.02,0:12:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it? Damn it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.13,0:12:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Jealous? Could you be jealous?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.27,0:12:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.05,0:12:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure about that?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.54,0:12:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn. I wouldn't fall for \Na brat like you, anyway.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.05,0:12:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're a lord, and I only \Ncarry your shoes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.43,0:12:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one can make that \Nbig a jump in status.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.68,0:12:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that look on your face?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.12,0:12:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.43,0:12:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing much!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.33,0:12:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.38,0:12:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you plotting rebellion or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.88,0:12:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly rebellion. \NMore like conquest.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Conquest of what, exactly?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.32,0:12:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.61,0:12:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sunset.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.80,0:12:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's up.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.53,0:13:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm cutting off your head, Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.89,0:13:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.20,0:13:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm the countess of Owari Province.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.28,0:13:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot let my personal feelings interfere.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.53,0:13:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't give you my head, \NNobukatsu will rebel.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.49,0:13:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That has to be avoided at all costs.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.47,0:13:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Any last words?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.13,0:13:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you do!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.16,0:13:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't want to die!" \Nor "Don't kill me!"
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.41,0:13:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.88,0:13:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If I beg for my life, \Nit'll make this harder for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.08,0:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.98,0:13:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,don't like this stuff at all, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.02,0:13:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.79,0:13:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not worth letting an idiot like you live.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.49,0:13:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.56,0:13:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only doing this because you told me to.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.31,0:14:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.44,0:14:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Inuchiyo! Goemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.32,0:14:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.86,0:14:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We were interrupted on the \Nway and time ran out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.20,0:14:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The rice is being brought in now.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.26,0:14:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.53,0:14:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How much is there?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.91,0:14:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,30,000 koku.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.27,0:14:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,30,000 koku?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.70,0:14:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's almost four times \Nwhat I asked for!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.44,0:14:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sagara succeeded.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.31,0:14:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.84,0:14:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Be happy, Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.03,0:14:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result of your success, \Nyou may keep your head.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.96,0:14:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So I got a reprieve, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.10,0:14:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But this success belongs to \N{\i1}these two{\i0} for their hard work.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.61,0:14:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And be very grateful for my compassion.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.61,0:14:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.15,0:14:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so not cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.48,0:14:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.61,0:14:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Disaster.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Nobukatsu has rebelled.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.83,0:14:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's raised an army at Suemori Castle!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.99,0:14:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.75,0:15:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It was Master Nobukatsu's forces who tried to stop us.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.30,0:15:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(2613,0,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Since they failed, he decided to raise an army.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.10,0:15:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuma Nobunori{-dono} and Hayashi Michikatsu{-dono}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.41,0:15:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,have barricaded themselves inside the castle with Master Nobukatsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.22,0:15:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As has Katsuie.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.22,0:15:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reconsider!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.70,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Master Nobukatsu's \Nadvisor, Katsuie{-dono}.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.00,0:15:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to show your loyalty.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.72,0:15:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.65,0:15:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll attack Suemori Castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.49,0:15:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.35,0:15:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.59,0:15:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Master Nobukatsu is merely being prompted by Sakuma{-dono} and Hayashi{-dono}.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.49,0:15:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.42,0:15:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.75,0:15:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't have a power struggle right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.12,0:15:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as the Imagawa learn of this, they'll attack.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.42,0:15:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We capture Suemori Castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.15,0:15:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our only hope.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.64,0:15:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At this rate...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.26,0:15:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she'll kill her brother, \Njust like in the game.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.40,0:15:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you capture Suemori Castle...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.95,0:16:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobukatsu just has to surrender, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.29,0:16:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The next morning, 1200 of Nobuna's \Nmen surrounded Suemori Castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.16,0:16:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Can we really beat my sister?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.95,0:16:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We have the fierce general \NShibata Katsuie with us.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.76,0:16:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's prepared to sacrifice her life to do so,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.78,0:16:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll be able to slay the foolish princess.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.20,0:16:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,W-We don't have to kill her.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.91,0:16:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nobuna! Nobuna! Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.93,0:16:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.93,0:16:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna! Shout even louder!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.53,0:16:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let everyone in that castle know \Nthat our leader is Oda Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.06,0:16:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we really win like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.82,0:16:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Nobukatsu is very weak-willed.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.58,0:16:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We simply need to make him loose his will to fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.44,0:16:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a splendid plan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.96,0:16:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighty-two points.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.30,0:16:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is kind of embarrassing.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.45,0:17:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.79,0:17:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to fight the princess.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.05,0:17:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.46,0:17:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna! Nobuna! Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.46,0:17:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something about that yelling!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.22,0:17:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.23,0:17:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.16,0:17:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.40,0:17:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.82,0:17:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.49,0:17:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I surrender!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.75,0:17:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,By not restraining Master Nobukatsu, I have failed as a minister.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.22,0:17:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take my life and forgive him.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.75,0:17:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}If I lose you, how am I supposed to fight the Imagawa?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.16,0:17:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.48,0:18:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you'll spare Master Nobukatsu?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.20,0:18:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobukatsu commits seppuku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.62,0:18:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll really hurt!{no shit}\NI don't want to die like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.83,0:18:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, Sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.85,0:18:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.84,0:18:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll kill you myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.53,0:18:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.86,0:18:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.58,0:18:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A count can't let their personal \Nfeelings get in the way.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.66,0:18:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, anyone who goes against me,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.85,0:18:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,family or not, will be killed.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.47,0:18:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of our conquest.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.95,0:18:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of the people!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.42,0:18:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody has a problem with that, do they?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.10,0:18:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.13,0:18:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.00,0:18:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjuurou.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.56,0:18:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.87,0:18:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna, don't kill your brother!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.98,0:18:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to go against me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.28,0:18:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.23,0:18:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you kill him here,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.11,0:18:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to go on killing \Neveryone you care about.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.24,0:18:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to end up a monster!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.57,0:19:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let him go because he's a relative of mine,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.76,0:19:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,then how can I set an \Nexample to everyone else?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.95,0:19:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.62,0:19:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've known the life of a count,\N much like you, very well.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.69,0:19:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since he killed his \Nrebellious younger brother,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.70,0:19:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it destroyed a part of his \Nheart, and he lost control.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.43,0:19:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to end up like him!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.51,0:19:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to stay the girl who spins\Na globe and talks about her dreams!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.93,0:19:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do you want me to do?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.10,0:19:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Be honest with yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.90,0:19:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you really want to do with him?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.65,0:19:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to kill him!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.38,0:19:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Does any girl want to kill her little brother?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all you had to say.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.04,0:19:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.33,0:19:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll forgive Nobukatsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.04,0:20:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be reborn and work for you, my sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.59,0:20:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never start another rebellion.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.53,0:20:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I will abandon the name of Oda,\Ntake the name of our Tsuda relatives,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.95,0:20:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and henceforth be called Tsuda Nobusumi!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.52,0:20:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuda Nobusumi, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.96,0:20:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of the rebels were also forgiven,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.84,0:20:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and swore their loyalty to Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.34,0:20:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, Owari was united under Oda Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.44,0:20:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In your future, the moon still shines like this, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.23,0:20:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty much.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.02,0:20:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you finally believe \NI'm from the future?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.08,0:20:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That person who killed his brother...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.02,0:20:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,really existed, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.13,0:21:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know {\i1}your{\i0} future.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.90,0:21:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you did, \NI'd kill you if you told me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.55,0:21:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Harsh.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.09,0:21:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to think that \NI'm being controlled by you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.92,0:21:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.98,0:21:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.51,0:21:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I can see that you're going\Nto lose sight of your own path,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.98,0:21:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do something about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.29,0:21:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.69,0:21:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.51,0:21:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can swear an oath of loyalty.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.68,0:21:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,An oath?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.26,0:21:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The barbarian way is much \Ncooler, and more elegant.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.07,0:21:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiss my hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.66,0:21:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is how a knight swears \Nloyalty to a princess.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.78,0:21:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.93,0:21:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sagara Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.68,0:21:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Swear that I will be your lord,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and your loyalty will never die.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.95,0:21:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.35,0:21:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you swear eternal loyalty to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.95,0:21:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I find a way back to my time.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.25,0:21:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Until then.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.31,0:22:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll never betray you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.52,0:22:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make your dream come true.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.81,0:22:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then if my dream never comes true,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.93,0:22:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't ever leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.20,0:22:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.22,0:22:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshiharu, swear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:23:49.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{ed}
